WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.532 --> 00:00:19.354
car pulled over on a dirt road, and the billionaire opened the car door.

2
00:00:19.374 --> 00:00:24.817
"Follow me to the P.O.D.'s hiding spot," Lainie said.

3
00:00:26.478 --> 00:00:29.140
Ally trudged along behind her on a desert path.

4
00:00:30.072 --> 00:00:34.094
"I wish I had some proof that Lainie is a Carparian," she thought.

5
00:00:34.695 --> 00:00:36.656
But how could she prove something like that?

6
00:00:36.676 --> 00:00:42.099
"I'm so excited you're going to be flying with me," Lainie said.

7
00:00:42.119 --> 00:00:45.281
"I think you'll find we have a lot in common.

8
00:00:45.821 --> 00:00:49.583
We're both adventurous, and we have the same taste in jewelry."

9
00:00:53.966 --> 00:00:56.047
we're probably both from space!"

10
00:00:56.507 --> 00:00:57.008
Ally thought.

11
00:00:57.692 --> 00:01:04.056
Suddenly she remembered something her mother had told her when she first gave Ally the meld medallion: "Your

12
00:01:04.136 --> 00:01:07.198
meld medallion will enable you to take on other forms.

13
00:01:08.099 --> 00:01:12.002
But when other beings wear it, it will reveal their true form."

14
00:01:12.022 --> 00:01:15.264
"Hmm," Ally thought.

15
00:01:15.284 --> 00:01:20.227
"I wonder if I could get Lainie to try on my meld medallion."

16
00:01:21.368 --> 00:01:27.312
The problem was, the second Ally removed the meld medallion, she would return to her Astralian form.

17
00:01:28.828 --> 00:01:30.048
She couldn't let that happen.

18
00:01:30.829 --> 00:01:33.649
But as they walked along, Ally kept thinking about it.

19
00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:38.311
Finally, she got the perfect idea.

20
00:01:39.811 --> 00:01:45.132
"It's dangerous," she told herself, "but so is flying into space with a Carparian.

21
00:01:45.793 --> 00:01:46.893
It's worth a try."

22
00:01:49.494 --> 00:01:53.055
Lainie led Ally behind a large rock formation where her P.O.D.

23
00:01:53.115 --> 00:01:53.595
was hidden.

24
00:01:54.455 --> 00:01:58.156
When Ally first spotted the spaceship, she thought she was seeing things.

25
00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:00.941
It looked a lot like her escape pod.

26
00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:05.303
It was the same shape and size, and the hatch opened the same way.

27
00:02:08.924 --> 00:02:10.525
Even the inside looked similar!

28
00:02:13.086 --> 00:02:18.009
But as soon as Lainie began the tour, Ally realized how different it was from her pod.

29
00:02:18.989 --> 00:02:20.109
"My P.O.D.

30
00:02:20.149 --> 00:02:25.512
is designed to go from zero to the speed of light in less than one minute," Lainie said.

31
00:02:27.516 --> 00:02:34.339
"It's designed with antilaser shields and galactic ray shades, and it has three onboard gamma cannons."

32
00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:37.601
Ally wiped her brow.

33
00:02:37.621 --> 00:02:41.883
"I remember learning about gamma cannons in school," she thought.

34
00:02:41.903 --> 00:02:44.644
"I think Carparians invented them."

35
00:02:46.445 --> 00:02:49.446
Ally closed her eyes for a second to gather all her courage.

36
00:02:49.986 --> 00:02:53.448
It was time to find out Lainie's true identity once and for all.

37
00:02:55.088 --> 00:02:59.691
As Lainie continued the tour, Ally casually began playing with the chain of her medallion.

38
00:02:59.711 --> 00:03:06.416
"The bathroom is through that door," Lainie said, "and all our food is stored in this cabinet.

39
00:03:07.156 --> 00:03:12.360
Everything is dehydrated and needs to She had just noticed Ally's meld medallion.

40
00:03:14.841 --> 00:03:20.765
"Remind me, Ally, where on earth did your parents get that amazing necklace?"

41
00:03:20.785 --> 00:03:24.348
"I'm not sure," Ally replied.

42
00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.801
"Would you like to see it up close?"

43
00:03:27.641 --> 00:03:28.782
Lainie's eyes lit up.

44
00:03:29.482 --> 00:03:30.563
"I'd love to!"

45
00:03:31.864 --> 00:03:37.447
Ally started to take the medallion off, but then she stopped, pretending to struggle to remove it.

46
00:03:37.467 --> 00:03:40.749
"Oof! The chain is tangled in my hair."

47
00:03:40.769 --> 00:03:43.830
"Let me help," Lainie said.

48
00:03:44.271 --> 00:03:45.992
But Ally was ready with her plan.

49
00:03:46.012 --> 00:03:47.192
"I've got it."

50
00:03:47.673 --> 00:03:49.334
She backed away toward the bathroom.

51
00:03:49.354 --> 00:03:53.416
"I just need to see what I'm doing in the mirror."

52
00:03:54.852 --> 00:03:57.653
Ally ducked into the bathroom and pulled her medallion off.

53
00:03:59.573 --> 00:04:01.494
Then she slipped it under the door.

54
00:04:01.514 --> 00:04:05.075
"Here, you can look at it while I get the knots out of my hair."

55
00:04:05.095 --> 00:04:11.297
"Thanks!" Ally crouched to watch through the keyhole as Lainie examined the medallion.

56
00:04:11.917 --> 00:04:16.278
She turned it over, felt the weight in her hand; she even sniffed it.

57
00:04:16.838 --> 00:04:21.640
But just as she was about to slip it on over her head, the sounds of shouting erupted

58
00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:22.580
outside the pod.

59
00:04:24.168 --> 00:04:25.069
"Blast it!

60
00:04:25.349 --> 00:04:27.551
People have discovered my P.O.D.!"

61
00:04:27.891 --> 00:04:28.572
Lainie cried.

62
00:04:28.972 --> 00:04:33.356
She ran out of the P.O.D., Ally's meld medallion clutched in her hand!

63
00:04:37.159 --> 00:04:38.120
"Oh no!"

64
00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.902
Ally moaned, looking at herself in the mirror.

65
00:04:40.922 --> 00:04:44.645
"I can't let anyone see me looking like an Astralian!

66
00:04:45.326 --> 00:04:46.206
What do I do?

67
00:04:46.907 --> 00:04:48.168
I wish Mateo was here.

68
00:04:48.648 --> 00:04:50.150
If only I had a comm device.

69
00:04:51.531 --> 00:04:52.732
Wait, I do!"

70
00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.502
Ally pulled Alpha out of her pocket.

71
00:04:55.522 --> 00:04:59.305
"Alpha," she commanded, "call Mateo."

72
00:05:00.026 --> 00:05:03.929
The phone rang once, twice, three times.

73
00:05:03.949 --> 00:05:05.911
"Come on, Mateo.

74
00:05:06.352 --> 00:05:07.893
Please answer this call!"

75
00:05:08.273 --> 00:05:08.954
Ally whispered.

76
00:05:10.015 --> 00:05:12.977
On the fourth ring, she finally heard Mateo's voice.

77
00:05:12.997 --> 00:05:14.799
"Hello?" he said.

78
00:05:14.819 --> 00:05:16.300
"Mateo! Quick!

79
00:05:16.761 --> 00:05:20.044
I need you to—" "This is Mateo," his voice continued.

80
00:05:20.512 --> 00:05:22.693
"I'm sorry I can't get to my phone right now.

81
00:05:23.013 --> 00:05:26.094
Please leave a message, and I'll get back to you as soon as I can."

82
00:05:26.414 --> 00:05:29.776
Beeep! Ally sank to the floor.

83
00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:32.957
"What do I do now?

84
00:05:33.597 --> 00:05:37.058
Without Mateo's help, I might never get my medallion back.

85
00:05:38.019 --> 00:05:40.760
This is awful I'm doomed!"
